    "updated_at": "2025-04-14T10:31:28Z",
    "body": "In [get the _attr_-associated elements](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/common-dom-interfaces.html#attr-associated-elements), step 4.2.\n\n> If _contentAttributeValue_ is null, then return null.\n\n(and if it could never be null, then the type should be `FrozenArray<T>`, not `FrozenArray<T>?`; but there are tests in WPT that check for this nullness, e.g. https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/6b105fe9035c980be1d4f8564d539d50d7441cfd/html/dom/aria-element-reflection.html#L354)",
